  "author": "Azzinoth",
  "date": "2026-11-12T01:11:58Z",
  "message": "FENaiveSceneGraph::GetNodeByEntityID now finds node in map of entity ID to node, previously it searched the whole scene graph from the root on every call; FENaiveSceneGraphNode now stores graph it belongs to; FENaiveSceneGraphNode::AddChild and DetachChild now add and remove node with all its children in that map; FENaiveSceneGraph::Clear now clears the map before deleting nodes; Added FENaiveSceneGraph::ValidateEntityIndex, it returns true if the map holds exactly the nodes that are in the scene graph; FENaiveSceneGraphNode::AddChild now rejects node from a different scene; Added scene graph tests for the map and for AddChild with node from a different scene, existing tests now check the map after load, import, duplication and deletion.",
